  "title": "FLOWERS FOODS ANNOUNCES MICHELLE LORGE AS PRESIDENT OF SIMPLE MILLS",
  "summary": "THOMASVILLE, Ga., Mar. 2, 2026 — Flowers Foods, Inc. (NYSE: FLO) today announced that Michelle Lorge has been appointed president of Simple Mills. Lorge will report directly to Ryals McMullian, chairman and CEO of Flowers Foods. She succeeds Katlin Smith, founder and CEO of Simple Mills, who has made a personal decision to step down...",
